  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: EventHorizon.Runtime::EventHorizon.Interaction.ScienceInspectable
  title: Mars 2020 Perseverance Rover
  facts: 'Landed in Jezero crater on 18 Feb 2021. Mass 1,025 kg, about 3 m long. Powered by an MMRTG: ~110 W electrical from the heat of plutonium-238 decay. Its MOXIE experiment made the first oxygen on another planet, up to 12 g per hour.'
  showSeconds: 8
